{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜立法會大會續會／美酒佳餚巡禮開幕\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261029.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】立法會大會今日(10月29日)續會，討論議員議案，推動新時代下教師專業發展。而美酒佳餚巡禮今晚開幕，活動一連四日在中環海濱活動空間及添馬公園舉行。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T00:00:22.691389+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":81,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T23:22:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T00:58:12.036771+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T23:58:26.328877+00:00","content_hash":"27d605318fa7312b87bf512f70587710569fa6a6be71d1e86c7c3cfe86b5db73","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T00:00:22.691389+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}